    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry Property are delighted to present this bright and spacious two-bedroom ground floor apartment for sale, ideally situated in the popular Clonmore area of Ardee.\r\n\r\nBuilt circa 2003 and extending to approximately 70m², this well-proportioned property benefits from its own private front door, gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows and designated parking facilities.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, spacious living room, kitchen/dining room, two bedrooms and a family bathroom. The property offers comfortable and practical living accommodation and would make an ideal first-time home or investment property.\r\n\r\nClonmore is conveniently located approximately 1.6 km from Ardee town centre, with a wide range of amenities nearby including primary and secondary schools, crèches, supermarkets, shops, restaurants, pubs, sporting facilities, churches and public transport services.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the M1 motorway is just over a 10-minute drive away, providing convenient access to both north and southbound routes. Dundalk is approximately 27 km away, while Drogheda is approximately 23 km away. Dublin City Centre is approximately 75 km away and Belfast approximately 108 km, depending on traffic and route. Ardee is also served by Bus Éireann and Local Link services, providing connections to surrounding towns and onward destinations.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
